[en.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR]
Another Year

[en.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR_desc]
For harmonism! The Resistance is about to welcome a new year, and we will continue to promote friendship and harmonism to all of Equestria!

[en.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR_TOOLTIP]
§eStarlight Glimmer and the Resistance are ready to welcome the new year§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR]
跨越新年

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR_desc]
谐律万岁！抵抗军即将迎来新的一年，我们会让友谊与谐律继续发扬光大，传给全小马利亚！

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ANOTHER_YEAR_TOOLTIP]
§e星光熠熠与抵抗军已经准备好迎接新的一年§!

